e receptor tyrosine kinase and catalyzes formation of DAG and IP3 second messengers (Carpenter and Ji 1999). Activation of rat Ntrk3 by human NTF3 (NT-3) is known to result in tyrosine phosphorylation of rat Plcg1 and activation of DAG and IP3 signaling (Marsh and Palfrey 1996).", "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "isChimeric": false, "category": "uncertain", "input": [{"dbId": 9034820, "displayName": "NTF3:p-5Y-NTRK3 homodimer:p-4Y-PLCG1 [plasma membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-9034820", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-9034820.1", "maxDepth": 4, "name": ["NTF3:p-5Y-NTRK3 homodimer:p-4Y-PLCG1"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "consumedByEvent": [9034855], "isChimeric": false, "species": [48887], "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "Complex", "className": "Complex"}], "output": [{"dbId": 9034727, "displayName": "NTF3:p-5Y-NTRK3 homodimer [plasma membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-9034727", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-9034727.1", "maxDepth": 3, "name": ["NTF3:p-5Y-NTRK3 homodimer"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "producedByEvent": [9034855], "isChimeric": false, "species": [48887], "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "Complex", "className": "Complex"}, {"dbId": 167679, "displayName": "p-4Y-PLCG1 [plasma membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-167679", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-167679.2", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["p-4Y-PLCG1", "p-Y1253,Y472,Y771,Y783-PLCG1", "p-Y472,771,783,1253-PLCG1", "p4Y-PLCG1", "p-PLCG1", "Phospho-Phospholipase C gamma 1", "Phospho-PLC gamma 1"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "catalystActivities": [{"dbId": 167676, "displayName": "phosphatidylinositol-4,5-bisphosphate phospholipase C activity of p-4Y-PLCG1 [plasma membrane]", "physicalEntity": 167679, "className": "CatalystActivity", "schemaClass": "CatalystActivity"}], "producedByEvent": [9034855], "species": 48887, "endCoordinate": 1290, "